 h-4 accent-[#0b2545]"><span><strong class="block text-xs text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Notify the payer</strong><small class="mt-0.5 block text-[10px] text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">Send the payment link using their email or phone number.</small></span></label></section>
